{"name":"图片","description":"在网页或软件里显示头像、商品图、文章配图等图片 · 例如商品列表应先为封面留出固定位置，图片加载后再按比例裁切，避免页面突然跳动。图片本身承载信息时要填写文字说明，方便图片加载失败或使用读屏的人理解；纯装饰图片不需要朗读。","quote":"文章里要能插图，手机上别变形。","agentPrompt":"请统一商品卡片的图片容器比例，加载前就预留空间，图片用等比裁切而不是拉伸。内容图片补充有意义的 alt，加载失败显示兜底；用横图、竖图和慢速网络检查不变形、不跳动。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-image\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>图片<span>Image</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">文章里要能插图，手机上别变形。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">在网页或软件里显示头像、商品图、文章配图等图片</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如商品列表应先为封面留出固定位置，图片加载后再按比例裁切，避免页面突然跳动。图片本身承载信息时要填写文字说明，方便图片加载失败或使用读屏的人理解；纯装饰图片不需要朗读。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>图像</em><em>图片组件</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"im-demo\"><div class=\"im-box\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div><div class=\"im-mask\">🔍 预览</div></div><div class=\"im-box fail\"><span class=\"im-fallback\">⚠<br>加载失败</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请统一商品卡片的图片容器比例，加载前就预留空间，图片用等比裁切而不是拉伸。内容图片补充有意义的 alt，加载失败显示兜底；用横图、竖图和慢速网络检查不变形、不跳动。</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\">容易混淆？这样区分</div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>图片<small>Image</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/icon?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"icon\">图标 <b>Icon</b></a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/image?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"image\" aria-label=\"图片 Image\">图片 <b>Image</b></a> 展示照片、插画或内容本身；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/icon?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"icon\" aria-label=\"图标 Icon\">图标 <b>Icon</b></a> 用简短、重复的小符号表达功能或状态。</p></div><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>图片<small>Image</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/video?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"video\">视频 <b>Video</b></a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/image?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"image\" aria-label=\"图片 Image\">图片 <b>Image</b></a> 是一张静态画面；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/video?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"video\" aria-label=\"视频 Video\">视频 <b>Video</b></a> 有播放、暂停、时长和声音等随时间变化的内容。</p></div></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>封面、头像、商品图</b>等常见图片展示场景</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:26px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">封面</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">商品图</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要<b>点击放大</b>看细节，自带预览交互</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">缩略图</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">→ 点击</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:30px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">放大预览</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">图片可能<b>加载失败</b>，要有兜底占位</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:26px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg-hover);color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">⚠ 加载失败</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">加载失败时显示占位和说明</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">容器比例固定，图片<b>裁切填充不变形</b></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);flex:none\"></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">按指定宽高<b>强制拉伸</b>，导致图片比例失真</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:44px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);flex:none\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">大量图片<b>同时加载</b>，明显阻塞页面响应</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把<b>标题文字只做进图里</b>，搜索和读屏无法读取</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:124px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">新品发布会 · 限时 5 折</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">缺少 <b>alt 描述</b>，加载失败后无法说明图片内容</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:28px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg-hover);color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">⚠ 加载失败</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"im-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"img\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0\"><span class=\"im-photo\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"mask\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:22px\"><span class=\"im-mask\" style=\"position:static;height:100%;font-size:12px\">🔍 预览</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">图片容器</span><span class=\"pe\">Image</span></button><span class=\"pd\">决定尺寸和裁切方式</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"img\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">图片本体</span><span class=\"pe\">Img</span></button><span class=\"pd\">真正展示的内容</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"mask\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">预览遮罩</span><span class=\"pe\">Mask</span></button><span class=\"pd\">悬停出现，点击放大</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">裁剪填充<span>Cover</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"im-box\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">容器比例固定，宁可裁掉也不变形</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">完整显示<span>Contain</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"im-box im-contain\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">图的内容不能裁，留边也要看全</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">圆形头像<span>Circle</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"im-box im-circle\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">头像专用，圆角裁成圆形</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">加载失败<span>Fallback</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"im-box fail\"><span class=\"im-fallback\">⚠<br>加载失败</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">图片加载出错时的兜底占位</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">商品封面</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-workspace.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">桌面升降台</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥1,299</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-mountain.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">户外登山包 40L</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥459</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">用户头像</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">林小hu</b> · 2 小时前</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">这组场景图太直观了，已抄进团队规范 👍</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">ans-studio</b> · 5 小时前</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">正愁怎么跟新人解释空状态，转发了</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">点击放大预览</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px\">文章配图（悬停出现预览遮罩）：</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/photo-cat.png&#x27;) center/cover\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.45);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">🔍 预览</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-mountain.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">加载失败兜底</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-hover);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:18px\">🖼️</span>图片加载失败\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7\">alt=&quot;山间徒步路线实拍&quot; —— 加载失败时仍显示占位和说明文字。</div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">&lt;img&gt;：图像嵌入元素</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://web.dev/learn/images\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">学习图片</span><span class=\"reference-source\">web.dev ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/image","markdown":"# 图片Image\n\n你可能会说\n文章里要能插图，手机上别变形。\n\n**在网页或软件里显示头像、商品图、文章配图等图片**·例如商品列表应先为封面留出固定位置，图片加载后再按比例裁切，避免页面突然跳动。图片本身承载信息时要填写文字说明，方便图片加载失败或使用读屏的人理解；纯装饰图片不需要朗读。\n\n也常被叫作图像图片组件\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请统一商品卡片的图片容器比例，加载前就预留空间，图片用等比裁切而不是拉伸。内容图片补充有意义的 alt，加载失败显示兜底；用横图、竖图和慢速网络检查不变形、不跳动。\n\n容易混淆？这样区分\n\n图片Image**≠**[图标 **Icon**](/vibe-hub/icon?lang=zh)\n\n[图片 **Image**](/vibe-hub/image?lang=zh) 展示照片、插画或内容本身；[图标 **Icon**](/vibe-hub/icon?lang=zh) 用简短、重复的小符号表达功能或状态。\n\n图片Image**≠**[视频 **Video**](/vibe-hub/video?lang=zh)\n\n[图片 **Image**](/vibe-hub/image?lang=zh) 是一张静态画面；[视频 **Video**](/vibe-hub/video?lang=zh) 有播放、暂停、时长和声音等随时间变化的内容。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **封面、头像、商品图**等常见图片展示场景\n\n封面商品图\n- 需要**点击放大**看细节，自带预览交互\n\n缩略图→ 点击放大预览\n- 图片可能**加载失败**，要有兜底占位\n\n⚠ 加载失败加载失败时显示占位和说明\n- 容器比例固定，图片**裁切填充不变形**\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 按指定宽高**强制拉伸**，导致图片比例失真\n- 大量图片**同时加载**，明显阻塞页面响应\n- 把**标题文字只做进图里**，搜索和读屏无法读取\n\n新品发布会 · 限时 5 折\n- 缺少 **alt 描述**，加载失败后无法说明图片内容\n\n⚠ 加载失败\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n🔍 预览\n\n1图片容器Image决定尺寸和裁切方式\n\n2图片本体Img真正展示的内容\n\n3预览遮罩Mask悬停出现，点击放大\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n裁剪填充Cover\n\n容器比例固定，宁可裁掉也不变形\n\n完整显示Contain\n\n图的内容不能裁，留边也要看全\n\n圆形头像Circle\n\n头像专用，圆角裁成圆形\n\n加载失败Fallback\n\n⚠\n加载失败\n\n图片加载出错时的兜底占位\n\n典型使用场景\n\n商品封面\n\n桌面升降台\n\n¥1,299\n\n      \n户外登山包 40L\n\n¥459\n\n用户头像\n\n**林小hu** · 2 小时前\n\n这组场景图太直观了，已抄进团队规范 👍\n\n      \n**ans-studio** · 5 小时前\n\n正愁怎么跟新人解释空状态，转发了\n\n点击放大预览\n\n文章配图（悬停出现预览遮罩）：\n\n      \n🔍 预览\n\n加载失败兜底\n\n🖼️图片加载失败\n\n      \nalt=\"山间徒步路线实拍\" —— 加载失败时仍显示占位和说明文字。\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[<img>：图像嵌入元素MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img)[学习图片web.dev ↗](https://web.dev/learn/images)"}